l9-11h-7Z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering <span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Tools</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 xl:flex 2xl:gap-5\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">LCA</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-orange-600\" href=\"/building-envelope\">Building</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-blue-700\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-sky-600\">Solar ↗</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">LCA Workspace</a></div><div class=\"shrink-0 xl:hidden\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><div class=\"min-w-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50 via-white to-slate-50\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"name\":\"Building Envelope Calculators\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/building-envelope\",\"description\":\"Free building envelope calculators for insulation, thermal performance, heat loss, energy savings and carbon payback.\"}</script><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><header class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-emerald-700\">Free Building Physics Tools</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl\">Building Envelope &amp; Insulation Calculators</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-lg\">Design and compare walls, roofs and floors; estimate insulation quantity; calculate R-value, U-value and heat loss; then connect retrofit energy savings with embodied carbon. Built for worldwide use with Metric and Imperial units.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-black text-slate-600\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2\">No signup</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2\">Metric + Imperial</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2\">Transparent methodology</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-2\">Product data can override presets</span></div></header><section class=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/insulation-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Insulation Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Estimate added R/RSI, thickness, volume, mass, packages and product cost.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/attic-insulation-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Attic Insulation Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Plan attic top-ups with existing insulation, target R-value and optional U.S. ENERGY STAR retrofit guidance.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/blown-in-insulation-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Blown-In Insulation Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Estimate loose-fill depth, volume, mass and bags using product-specific package data.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/wall-insulation-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Wall Insulation Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Estimate wall insulation thickness and quantity, then compare thermal performance and retrofit savings.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/r-value-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">R-Value Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Convert R-US, RSI and U-value and build multi-layer thermal assemblies.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/u-value-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">U-Value Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Calculate thermal transmittance from material thickness and declared conductivity.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/heat-loss-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Heat Loss Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Calculate fabric and ventilation heat loss, W/K, kW, BTU/h and optional annual degree-day energy.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/carbon-payback-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Insulation Carbon Payback</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Compare operational carbon savings with product-specific embodied carbon from EPD/LCA data.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a><a class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-lg\" href=\"/building-envelope/methodology\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-950 group-hover:text-emerald-700\">Methodology &amp; Data</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">See equations, scope limits, dataset versions, update policy and authoritative references.</p><div class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Open tool →</div></a></section><section class=\"mx-auto mt-12 max-w-5xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-9\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950\">Why these tools are different</h2><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900\">Physics first</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">The calculation engine is separate from the user interface and protected by regression tests. Core equations do not silently change when content or datasets are updated.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900\">Product data first</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Generic thermal presets are clearly labelled planning values. Declared conductivity, coverage and EPD data from the actual product can replace them.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-900\">Carbon connected</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Retrofit results can compare operational carbon savings against insulation embodied carbon rather than treating energy and LCA as unrelated calculations.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-5xl rounded-3xl bg-slate-950 p-6 text-slate-200 sm:p-9\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white\">Designed for worldwide use without pretending one code fits every country</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Thermal physics is calculated consistently, while local regulatory targets remain explicit user inputs unless an authoritative regional dataset is provided. The initial regional guidance dataset includes an optional U.S. ENERGY STAR retrofit reference. Users elsewhere can enter the R-value or U-value required by their own project, code or product specification.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-emerald-400\" href=\"/building-envelope/methodology\">Read methodology &amp; update policy</a><a class=\"rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-white/15\" href=\"/building-envelope/u-value-calculator\">Start with U-value calculator</a></div></section></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-6 lg:gap-7\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\">GreenEngineering Tools</a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Free browser-based engineering tools for carbon, building physics, electrical systems and sustainable design.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Core tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer core tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/building-envelope\">Building Envelope</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical Tools</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"block hover:text-white\">Solar Calculator ↗</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Building</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer building-envelope navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/building-envelope/insulation-calculator\">Insulation Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/building-envelope/u-value-calculator\">U-Value Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/building-envelope/heat-loss-calculator\">Heat Loss Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/building-envelope/carbon-payback-calculator\">Carbon Payback</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Electrical</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer electrical navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\">Voltage Drop</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/wire-size-calculator\">Wire Size</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/dc-wire-size-calculator\">DC Wire Size</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">LCA learning</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer LCA learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Company</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 spa